# []W_ARN raises an error resumably (ER3): the left argument is the
# value to go on with. A handler answering []C_ONTINUE e makes the
# program go on from the warning, with that value, so the rest of the
# body still runs.
== SOURCE
'{ @ -> 10 + (0 []W_ARN "empty" "nothing to add") } []T_RAP '{ e -> []C_ONTINUE e }
== TYPE
Int
== RESULT
10
